{"logId": "eee36661-5aaf-4434-92e9-ed6a3861cfa9", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [165, 140, 456, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [456.0, 140.0], [456.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "主题释义：", "block_bbox": [189, 215, 289, 241], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[188.99996948242188, 215.0], [282.9999694824219, 215.0], [282.9999694824219, 240.0], [188.99996948242188, 240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "从精神健康、心理健康到行为健康。不违背自由，尊重自由、坚信自由，保持轻松的精神面貌！懂得健康的原理，身体与情绪之间的影响作用，主动地让健康指标管控在合理的范围内；理解先进的文化理念和生活理念，运用到实际生活中，活出积极、乐观、阳光、自由的心态，积极主动地调整和掌控自我的生命质量！即便在面对疾病、灾难、感情困扰、工作烦恼等逆境时，也很容易坦然接受并释怀！让生命更加坦然和圆润！", "block_bbox": [184, 265, 1017, 446], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 265.0], [1017.0, 265.0], [1017.0, 446.0], [184.0, 446.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "[94]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 611, 739], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 738.0], [573.0, 738.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 492, 932], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [492.0, 900.0], [492.0, 932.0], [201.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "标准等级：", "block_bbox": [225, 975, 325, 1002], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 975.0], [325.0, 975.0], [325.0, 1002.0], [225.0, 1002.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：懂得健康的原理，身体与情绪相互之间的影响作用，避免造成严重的痛苦或不可挽回的身心伤害。", "block_bbox": [225, 1028, 1044, 1085], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1028.0], [1044.0, 1028.0], [1044.0, 1085.0], [225.0, 1085.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：保持积极、乐观的心态，有良好的自我调节能力，能够掌控自我情绪，也能够主动地调节身体指标保持相对健康的状态。", "block_bbox": [225, 1095, 1044, 1153], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1095.0], [1044.0, 1095.0], [1044.0, 1153.0], [225.0, 1153.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：比较成熟的心态，善于看到事物好的一面，具备把坏事变好事的能力，不断地进步和提升。", "block_bbox": [225, 1162, 1043, 1217], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1162.0], [1043.0, 1162.0], [1043.0, 1217.0], [225.0, 1217.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：感恩生命中的一切经历和发生，能够从风雨和苦难中品出美好和幸福。", "block_bbox": [225, 1229, 942, 1254], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1229.0], [942.0, 1229.0], [942.0, 1254.0], [225.0, 1254.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：活出洒脱、轻松、阳光、自由的生命状态，并影响和带动他人健康的观念和习惯。", "block_bbox": [226, 1263, 1034, 1289], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[226.0, 1263.0], [1034.0, 1263.0], [1034.0, 1289.0], [226.0, 1289.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[95]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 649, 1497], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1496.0], [611.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7514475584030151, "coordinate": [165, 140, 456, 173], "order": 1,